# The generated source images (Plan 11) and, until it is removed, the 3D pipeline's 400 MB of CC0
# archives and their unpacked contents. Both are *inputs* — to
# `apps/normal-web/scripts/avatar-pipeline.mjs` and `…/avatar-assets.mjs` — and neither is project
# state: what is committed is the layers those scripts emit under `apps/normal-web/public/avatar/`
# and `…/public/avatar3d/`. README.md says where each input comes from and, for the generated ones,
# what tool and seed made it.
#
# `!.gitignore` is not decoration: without it this file would ignore itself and could not be
# committed, which would leave every original one `git add -A` away from the history.
*
!.gitignore
!README.md
